  "notes": "Rank 0 appends --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8888; rank 1 appends --headless. PLE_EMBEDDING_DTYPE is detected at launch by files/detect_ple_dtype.py (README: FP8 PLE table) and injected via --hf-overrides. YARN_ENABLE=true + MAX_MODEL_LEN=1000000 gives ~1M ctx (README 'Default runtime' shows that 1M/kv auto variant with GMU 0.835). Image is an NVIDIA dev build (README: sha256:d464f3b4..., digest truncated). Also supports local-inference-lab / RadixArk NVFP4 checkpoints and ABLIT=1 gated abliterated checkpoint. KV fp8 default: 3,652,200 tokens.",
